## Exercise 119: Print a Rectangle
### 119
Print a Rectangle
<|info|>

### Problem
Write a program that prints a rectangle of a specified width and height to the screen.

### Sample Output
```
Enter width: 5
Enter height: 4
*****
*****
*****
*****
```

### Solution
```java
import java.util.Scanner;

public class ClassX {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Scanner input = new Scanner(System.in);
        System.out.print("Enter width: ");
        int width = input.nextInt();
        System.out.print("Enter height: ");
        int height = input.nextInt();

        for (int i = 1; i <= height; i++) {
            for (int j = 1; j <= width; j++) {
                System.out.print("*");
            }
            System.out.println();
        }
    }
}
```
