# Battles

## How to install

### Requirements

- Python 3.8+
- [Java 14+](https://www.oracle.com/java/technologies/javase-downloads.html)

### Install from PyPI

```console
pip install battles
```

## How to use

```console
battles -h
```

### Example

```console
battles
```

## How to contribute

```console
git clone https://github.com/LucaBriani/Battles.git
cd Battles
python -m venv.venv
source.venv/bin/activate
pip install -e.
