## Question

Write a method to get host name from URL.

## Answer

```java
public class ClassX {
    public static String getHost(URL url) {
        String host = url.getHost();
        if (host.endsWith("/")) {
            return host.substring(0, host.length() - 1);
        }
        return host;
    }
}
